          "listId": "f699e340-c141-4c20-a8f5-d8a2eac2773a",
          "title": "Serviceability + hubs",
          "description": "hub, zone, zone_pincode, delivery_slot. Replaces the 8 hardcoded Hyderabad areas. Hard prerequisite for cart — the pincode gate already blocks checkout client-side and needs a server behind it. Order placement must re-validate server-side regardless.",
