          "listId": "f699e340-c141-4c20-a8f5-d8a2eac2773a",
          "title": "Inventory (after catalog, before cart)",
          "description": "hub_inventory, stock_batch, stock_ledger, inventory_hold. Ordering matters: cart needs stock, and product.stock cannot stay a scalar once multi-hub is real. Almost entirely an admin surface; three inventory pages are still placeholders.",
