        {
          "id": "5feeead0-eb8d-440d-96dd-4a4896d7b788",
          "listId": "f699e340-c141-4c20-a8f5-d8a2eac2773a",
          "title": "Decide: ComingSoon pages in scope?",
          "description": "43 admin pages are placeholders. Some sit on modules whose data layer is already built (coupons, payments, category new/edit) — pure UI work. Others (dispatch, riders, BI, experiments) are whole features with no schema. Worth splitting explicitly rather than discovering it mid-phase.",
          "labels": [
            {
