        },
        {
          "id": "7ef134f4-9ce5-49b2-93bd-2e3b18c675d9",
          "listId": "f699e340-c141-4c20-a8f5-d8a2eac2773a",
          "title": "Decide: localStorage as offline cache?",
          "description": "Platform holds mutable state in seven localStorage contexts. Server-only is simpler but the cart empties on a flaky connection; server-backed with localStorage as cache needs conflict resolution. Decide before the cart phase — it changes the provider's shape.",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "95ad35dc-c324-4bec-affe-1e211039d65c",
              "title": "storefront",
              "color": "#4f8a5b"
